[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04050000_00_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04050000_00_0010","text":"（甜花……\n　是让甘奈帮她做课题吗）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04050000_00_0020","text":"甜花酱～\n英语课题，做完了哦～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04050000_00_0030","text":"小奈……！！\n谢、谢谢你……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04050000_00_0040","text":"（……不对\n　这与其说是帮忙，不如说……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04050000_00_0005","text":"喂喂"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04050000_00_0006","text":"……我也来\n帮忙吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04050000_00_0007","text":"不能全让甘奈\n替你做啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04050000_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04050000_01_0010","text":"课题得自己完成才有意义吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04050000_01_0020","text":"啊呜呜……可是……\n甜花一个人的话……时间，不够……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04050000_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04050000_02_0010","text":"甜花最近确实很忙嘛……\n只要是我能帮上忙的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04050000_02_0020","text":"诶……！！　那……\n数学的……拜托了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04050000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04050000_03_0010","text":"诶……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04050000_03_0020","text":"那……制作人会……\n帮我解题，是吗……？"}]
